Subject: [PATCH 08/12] kexec: don't invoke OOM-killer for control page
 allocation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Disposition: inline
Message-Id: <E1aviFE-0000jS-UI@rmk-PC.arm.linux.org.uk>
Date: Thu, 28 Apr 2016 10:28:24 +0100
